---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import ProtectedEmail from '../components/ProtectedEmail.astro';

const baseUrl = import.meta.env.BASE_URL;
---

<BaseLayout title="About">
 
  <p class="about-greeting">Hello all 👋</p>
  
  <p>
    I'm from Braga. I'm a software testing consultant and team lead at 
    <a class="content-link" href="https://www.noesis.pt/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Noesis</a>, 
    with more than 10 years of experience in the field.
  </p>

  <p>
    I started out with manual testing across different technologies and environments, then moved
    into API testing, and picked up automation along the way with Selenium, Robot Framework,
    Cypress and Playwright. I've also worked with BDD from the early stages of development,
    helping align the business and technical teams.
  </p>

  <p>
    I'm ISTQB CFTL and ITIL certified, but I'm just as shaped by being stubbornly
    curious about why things break. This is where I write about all of it.
  </p>

  <p><strong>Outside of work:</strong> music, guitar and classical literature.</p>

  <p>
    Got a question? Spotted a broken link, or anything else that looks off? Let me know, I'd
    appreciate it.
  </p>

  <p>
    In case you need me ✨<br />
    <ProtectedEmail email="hugfil@gmail.com" />
  </p>

  <section class="worked-with">
    <h2 class="worked-with-label">Worked With</h2>
    <div class="worked-with-grid">
      <div class="logo-card">
        <img src={`/personal-blog/grupo-pinero_logo.svg`} alt="Grupo Piñero" />
      </div>
      <div class="logo-card">
        <img src={`/personal-blog/mbcp_logo.svg`} alt="Millenium BCP" />
      </div>
      <div class="logo-card">
        <img src={`/personal-blog/f3m_logo.svg`} alt="F3M Information Systems, S.A." />
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

</BaseLayout>